OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785410316
OL,3,CUS launches fresh strikes on Iran
OL,4,Cafter Tehran targets American military
OL,5,Cbases
OL,7,FThe US has said it had carried out "a
OL,8,Fheavy wave of strikes against Iran" in
OL,9,Fresponse to Tehran's attempted attack
OL,10,Fon American military positions in
OL,11,FJordan.
OL,13,FUS Central Command said in a social
OL,14,Fmedia post that it had struck "dozens"
OL,15,Fof targets belonging to Iran's
OL,16,FRevolutionary Guard Corps over two
OL,17,Fhours early on Thursday.
OL,26,@oD@dOUpD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
