PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785410316
OL,3,CUS launches fresh strikes on Iran
OL,4,Cafter Tehran targets American military
OL,5,Cbases
OL,7,FThe targets included military command
OL,8,Fcentres, missile and drone facilities,
OL,9,Fand coastal surveillance and defence
OL,10,Fsites.
OL,12,FThe latest strikes came after the US
OL,13,Fjoined Saudi Arabia in attacking Iran-
OL,14,Fbacked militias in neighbouring Iraq,
OL,15,Fkilling at least 20 fighters and six
OL,16,FIranian advisers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785410316
OL,3,CUS launches fresh strikes on Iran
OL,4,Cafter Tehran targets American military
OL,5,Cbases
OL,7,FThe operation followed a pledge by US
OL,8,FPresident Donald Trump on Wednesday to
OL,9,Fhit Iran "very hard" after it targeted
OL,10,Fa military base in Jordan hosting
OL,11,FAmerican troops.
OL,13,FIranian state media said two people
OL,14,Fwere injured in attacks on the island
OL,15,Fof Qeshm in the Strait of Hormuz,
OL,16,Fwhile explosions were also reported in
OL,17,FKhuzestan province in the country's
OL,18,Fsouthwest.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785410316
OL,3,CUS launches fresh strikes on Iran
OL,4,Cafter Tehran targets American military
OL,5,Cbases
OL,7,FElsewhere, drone strikes set fire to
OL,8,Ftwo natural gas vessels at Egypt's
OL,9,FPort of Damietta, according to British
OL,10,Fmaritime security firm Ambrey.
OL,12,FIt was not immediately clear who was
OL,13,Fresponsible for the attacks on a US-
OL,14,Fowned floating storage facility and a
OL,15,FGreek-owned tanker. No injuries were
OL,16,Freported.
OL,18,FThe latest flare-ups on multiple
OL,19,Ffronts after several days of relative
OL,20,Fcalm have raised fears of a return to
OL,21,Fall-out war.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785410316
OL,3,CUS launches fresh strikes on Iran
OL,4,Cafter Tehran targets American military
OL,5,Cbases
OL,7,FThey also highlight the difficulty of
OL,8,Fbringing an end to the five-month
OL,9,Fconflict, which has shaken the global
OL,10,Feconomy.
OL,12,FThe renewed fighting is also likely to
OL,13,Ffuel concerns that the US is further
OL,14,Fdepleting its already diminished
OL,15,Fstockpiles of advanced munitions
OL,16,Fneeded to defend its military bases
OL,17,Fand allies.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
