FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785410316
OL,3,CUS launches fresh strikes on Iran
OL,4,Cafter Tehran targets American military
OL,5,Cbases
OL,7,FEgypt, a key US ally and regional
OL,8,Fmediator, is one of the few countries
OL,9,Fin the Middle East to have avoided
OL,10,Fdirect military action during the
OL,11,Fconflict.
OL,13,FAny confirmed strike by Iran or its
OL,14,Fallies on Egyptian territory would
OL,15,Fmark a significant escalation and
OL,16,Fbroadening of the war.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
