FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785410316
OL,3,CUS launches fresh strikes on Iran
OL,4,Cafter Tehran targets American military
OL,5,Cbases
OL,7,FAsked during an Oval Office event if
OL,8,FIran was responsible for the strikes
OL,9,Fon the natural gas vessels, Trump
OL,10,Fresponded: "It's a little more of the
OL,11,Fsame."
OL,13,F"In the meantime, we're going to be
OL,14,Fhitting them very hard because it's
OL,15,Four turn to hit them," he added.
OL,17,FSaudi Arabia accused Iran-backed
OL,18,Fmilitias in Iraq of launching drone
OL,19,Fattacks on its oil facilities over the
OL,20,Fpast two days.
OL,26,@rD@LOUsD@FO]uD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
