OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785410316
OL,3,CUS launches fresh strikes on Iran
OL,4,Cafter Tehran targets American military
OL,5,Cbases
OL,7,FAn umbrella group representing the
OL,8,FIraqi militias denied the allegations,
OL,9,Fwhile Yemen's Iran-backed Houthi
OL,10,Frebels said they had separately
OL,11,Ftargeted Saudi energy facilities as
OL,12,Fpart of a related conflict.
OL,14,FUS officials said Saudi Arabia's
OL,15,Fdecision to join American strikes on
OL,16,Fthe Iraqi militias was intended to
OL,17,Fsend a message to Iran that it would
OL,18,Fnot tolerate attacks by Tehran or its
OL,19,Fproxies on the kingdom's oil industry
OL,20,Fand other critical infrastructure.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785410316
OL,3,CUS launches fresh strikes on Iran
OL,4,Cafter Tehran targets American military
OL,5,Cbases
OL,7,FAt the same time, Saudi Arabia's
OL,8,Fdefence minister told Trump and Vice
OL,9,FPresident JD Vance that Riyadh wanted
OL,10,Fto see the conflict de-escalate and
OL,11,Ffor Washington and Tehran to return to
OL,12,Fnegotiations.
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
