OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785410316
OL,3,CUS launches fresh strikes on Iran
OL,4,Cafter Tehran targets American military
OL,5,Cbases
OL,7,FBefore the latest escalation,
OL,8,Fmediators had expressed optimism about
OL,9,Fbringing the US and Iran back to the
OL,10,Fnegotiating table.
OL,12,FHowever, an interim agreement
OL,13,Fcollapsed in recent weeks after
OL,14,Frenewed fighting in the Strait of
OL,15,FHormuz, the vital shipping route for
OL,16,Fglobal energy supplies that has again
OL,17,Fbeen effectively closed by Iranian
OL,18,Fattacks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785410316
OL,3,CUS launches fresh strikes on Iran
OL,4,Cafter Tehran targets American military
OL,5,Cbases
OL,7,FA regional official said mediators
OL,8,Fwere "still trying with both sides" to
OL,9,Frestore calm and revive the ceasefire,
OL,10,Fbut did not indicate whether progress
OL,11,Fhad been made.
OL,13,FThe renewed hostilities sent oil
OL,14,Fprices sharply higher, with Brent
OL,15,Fcrude, the international benchmark,
OL,16,Frising 7.3% to $88.09 (about #66) a
OL,17,Fbarrel.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/11
